OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal e-bikes to be seized and
OL,4,Adestroyed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllegal e-bikes and e-scooters will be
OL,7,Fseized and destroyed under a new
OL,8,Fcrackdown announced by Surrey Police.
OL,10,FThe force has launched Operation
OL,11,FScramble, which will see roads policing
OL,12,Fofficers and neighbourhood teams
OL,13,Fcarrying out patrols across the county.
OL,15,FPolice said the operation would target
OL,16,F"reckless, antisocial and illegal
OL,17,Friders".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
