OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal e-bikes to be seized and
OL,4,Adestroyed
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Supt Graham Barnett said the
OL,7,Fillegal use of the vehicles was a
OL,8,Fgrowing problem in Surrey and officers
OL,9,Fwould "tirelessly pursue riders who are
OL,10,Fcausing fear and nuisance in our
OL,11,Fcounty".
